    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Old Plum Grove Cemetery began as a family burial ground and now serves as a historic pioneer graveyard.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        18
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.historictexas.net/city/west-point-texas"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The town’s history dates back to 1902, when early records documented its development in Fayette County.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        16
